  "description": "Deep within an isolated prison, twelve girls await you. They are beautiful, intense… and dangerously unpredictable. Each one has a hidden story, an obsession, a secret that might make you crave their love… or fear for your life.\n\nThey want your attention. They need your affection. But in a place where madness and passion go hand in hand, one question looms over you:\n\nCan you win them over before you become their next victim?\n\n\nGame Features:\n\n● 12 girls, 12 disturbingly irresistible minds – From the enigmatic manipulator to the sweet psychopath with a deadly obsession, each inmate has a unique personality. Find out what drives them… and what sets them off.\n\n● Dynamic conversations and a dangerous game of seduction – Every word you choose can bring you closer to them… or seal your fate. Will you be their confidant, their obsession… or their prey?\n\n● A limited time to win their love (or escape alive) – Every decision matters. Will you conquer them… or realize too late that love can be a weapon?\n\n● Multiple endings – Your fate is in your hands. Will you find romance in the darkest place… or become trapped in a love you can’t escape?\n\n\nThey are waiting for you. And they won’t take \"no\" for an answer.\n\nDo you dare to play?",
